"Your KAS stays locked on chain until the owner accepts or declines, you withdraw the offer, or it expires - then anyone can send it back to you." = "I tuoi KAS restano bloccati sulla chain finché il proprietario accetta o rifiuta, ritiri l’offerta o scade: poi chiunque può restituirteli.";
